  "description": "Thirty-two offline developer tools in a floating window: JSON (JSONC repair, queries), JWT decode, verify and sign, YAML, CSV, types (TypeScript, Zod, Go, Rust, JSON Schema), XML/HTML/CSS/SQL formatters, hashes and HMAC with checksum compare, Base64 and data: URI images, QR codes, Unicode and ID inspectors, regex, diff, cron, colours, passwords and more. Search, pinned tools, chains, history and clipboard detection.",
